
                    DayDream BBS V1.00, Node Structure
                    ----------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   LONG WORD  04    POINTER TO THE PREVIOUS NODE ITEM                 (-)
 0004   LONG WORD  04    POINTER TO THE NEXT NODE STRUCTURE                (-)
 0008   LONG WORD  04    POINTER TO THE CALLER'S USER STRUCTURE (OR NULL)  (-)
 0012   FREE BLOCK 02    UNUSED                                            (-)
 0014   BYTE       01    NUMBER OF THIS NODE, RANGE: 1 -> 255              (-)
 0015   BYTE       01    FLAGS                                             (-)
 0016   LONG WORD  04    POINTER TO THE SCREEN OF THIS NODE (OR NULL)      (-)
 0020   LONG WORD  04    POINTER TO THE USER ACTIVITY STRING               (-)
 0024   LONG WORD  04    CONNECTION RATE                                   (-)
 0028	FREE BLOCK 22    FREE SPACE FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT                 (-)
 0050   -- END --  00    END OF THE DAYDREAM NODE STRUCTURE                (-)
==============================================================================

FLAGS 0 = Active Node
